WEBVTT

00:08:28.386 --> 00:08:31.080
što znače sve te skraćenice,

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:36.110
poput LOL, OMG, LMAO,

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.852
sve dok jednog dana nisam vodio razgovor

00:08:37.852 --> 00:08:40.108
s prijateljem preko poruka,

00:08:40.108 --> 00:08:44.139
i zamolio ga da nešto napravi, 
a on je odgovorio sa "K."

00:08:44.139 --> 00:08:47.318
Pitao sam ga, "Što je K?"

00:08:47.318 --> 00:08:49.280
A on je odgovorio "K je okej."

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:50.279
Pomislio sam,

00:08:50.279 --> 00:08:53.297
"Koji vrag ne valja s K?"

00:08:53.297 --> 00:08:55.810
Poslao sam mu upitnik.

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:59.481
Odgovorio je, "K = okej."

00:08:59.481 --> 00:09:04.170
A ja mu odgovorim, "FU." (j*i se) (Smijeh)